SNARE — Structural Notification Resolution Engine

Shunyaya Structural Notification Resolution Model

Legal Status

This license is a permissive Open Standard license for the SNARE reference implementation.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, this license grants rights similar in spirit to permissive open-source licenses.

These rights apply subject to truthful representation requirements regarding use of the SNARE name and representation of the reference implementation.

If any provision is found unenforceable, remaining provisions remain in effect.

Nature of Release

This is a minimal, self-contained reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate structural notification resolution, visibility governance, structural learning, and deterministic interruption management — not to represent an operating system notification subsystem, messaging platform, communication service, calendar platform, or production notification infrastructure.

Behavioral observations apply only within the scope of the reference implementation and its defined structural assumptions.

