Closing Statement

SNARE explores a simple but fundamental question:

Must notification visibility be application-defined?

Or can visibility emerge from structure?

SNARE explores notification visibility through:

notification

↓

structure

↓

resolution

↓

visibility

↓

attention

The reference implementation demonstrates deterministic notification resolution, structural learning, interruption governance, policy evaluation, replayable outcomes, and certificate reproducibility.

SNARE is released to encourage:

independent validation

real-world testing

safe experimentation

SNARE is offered as a minimal, verifiable reference implementation of structural notification resolution.
